    "content": {
      "id": "339b7918-b7ec-35fc-be2e-4280bb50eba5",
      "contentType": "VIDEO",
      "title": "The value that neocloud companies offer to major AI players",
      "description": "<p>Micron Technology (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MU\">MU</a>) stock continues to pop after <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/micron-stock-pops-blowing-past-211508178.html\">boasting strong fiscal first quarter earnings results </a>driven by demand around <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/ai-data-centers-are-eating-the-memory-industry-and-it-could-hurt-your-wallet-130814928.html\">high-bandwidth memory chips </a>for AI data centers. As more companies invest into large-scale AI infrastructure buildouts, what does this all mean for the broadening AI trade and even neocloud operators?</p>\n<p>Freedom Capital Markets Managing Director Paul Meeks talks about the three chip companies he still has at the top of his list and the upside that neocloud companies like CoreWeave (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CRWV\">CRWV</a>) could offer some of the bigger players, such as Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>).</p>\n<p>Also catch Paul Meeks explain how much higher <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/ai-buildouts-could-push-micron-164304450.html\">he sees Micron's stock going.</a></p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
      "summary": "Micron Technology (MU) stock continues to pop after boasting strong fiscal first quarter earnings results driven by demand around high-bandwidth memory chips for AI data centers. As more companies invest into large-scale AI infrastructure buildouts, what does this all mean for the broadening AI trade and even neocloud operators? Freedom Capital Markets Managing Director Paul Meeks talks about the three chip companies he still has at the top of his list and the upside that neocloud companies like CoreWeave (CRWV) could offer some of the bigger players, such as Nvidia (NVDA). Also catch Paul Meeks explain how much higher he sees Micron's stock going. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Market Catalysts.",
